THE SysopComment-Door for FINAL AMIGA MAILBOX ENGINE. This
is a complete rewrite. Main features include:

- 100% configurable (config door, design files)
- different sysops for different conferences
- INVERSE function
- flexible screen handling (no more design crashs)
